  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Alma",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 16,
    "summary": "The Lamanites destroy the people of Ammonihah—Zoram leads the Nephites to victory over the Lamanites—Alma and Amulek and many others preach the word—They teach that after His Resurrection Christ will appear to the Nephites. About 81–77 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass in the eleventh year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi, on the fifth day of the second month, there having been much peace in the land of Zarahemla, there having been no wars nor contentions for a certain number of years, even until the fifth day of the second month in the eleventh year, there was a cry of war heard throughout the land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 16:1",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "For behold, the armies of the Lamanites had come in upon the wilderness side, into the borders of the land, even into the city of Ammonihah, and began to slay the people and destroy the city.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 130,
            "end": 139,
            "text": "Alma 15:1 (1, 15–16); 49:3 (1–15)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 16:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And now it came to pass, before the Nephites could raise a sufficient army to drive them out of the land, they had destroyed the people who were in the city of Ammonihah, and also some around the borders of Noah, and taken others captive into the wilderness.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 115,
            "end": 124,
            "text": "Alma 9:18."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
