        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And there was no inequality among them; the Lord did pour out his Spirit on all the face of the land to prepare the minds of the children of men, or to prepare their hearts to receive the word which should be taught among them at the time of his coming—",
        "footNotes": [
